	(text "365 nm LED held at constant optical power by a photodiode loop in the MCU. I2C target 0x2A, 5 V in.\nLED current: I = (V_gate - V_GS) / R1, at most (5 V - V_f) / 3.9 R = 0.33 A (hardware limit).\nJ2 goes to the LED star through the UV ARM toggle switch (in the LED+ wire, on the housing)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 22 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6af0ff1c-e44e-44e3-aa8d-c94b98a1a7c8")
	)
